'''Chromatic''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting the [[Office Egg]], the [[Nuke Egg]], and the [[Nikilis Egg]] during the [[Easter Event 2023|2023 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
The spine of the blade is dark purple with a golden outline separating it from the chromatic edge, hence the name. The edge starts in a deep purple, which then fades into a lime green, which finally then fades into a vibrant red. The guard is golden, and the handle is dark purple with a crosshatch pattern connected by golden beads. The pommel, attached to the bottom of the handle, is golden.

== Trivia==
*It has a [[Chromatic (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*All the eggs needed to collect this knife are [[:Category:Legendary|legendary]] in rarity.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

